A tour's season schedule: one row per tournament (id, dates, course, purse, champion, points on offer), completed events first. Endpoint URL: POST https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql Example request: curl -X POST 'https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"operationName": "Schedule", "query": "query Schedule($tourCode: String!, $year: String) {
 schedule(tourCode: $tourCode, year: $year) {
 tour
 seasonYear
 completed { ...ScheduleMonthFields }
 upcoming { ...ScheduleMonthFields }
 }
}

fragment ScheduleMonthFields on ScheduleMonth {
 month
 year
 tournaments {
 id
 tournamentName
 date
 startDate
 sequenceNumber
 tournamentStatus
 courseName
 city
 state
 stateCode
 country
 countryCode
 purse
 champion
 championId
 championEarnings
 tourStandingHeading
 tourStandingValue
 }
}
", "variables": {"tourCode": "R", "year": "2026"}}'

One tournament's leaderboard: position, total to par, strokes, holes completed, today's score, round scores and projected FedExCup rank per player. Endpoint URL: POST https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql Example request: curl -X POST 'https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"operationName": "LeaderboardCompressedV3", "query": "query LeaderboardCompressedV3($id: ID!) {
 leaderboardCompressedV3(id: $id) {
 id
 payload
 }
}
", "variables": {"id": "R2026014"}}'

One player's scorecard for a tournament: one row per hole per round (par, yardage, strokes, birdie / bogey status, running score to par). Endpoint URL: POST https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql Example request: curl -X POST 'https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"operationName": "ScorecardCompressedV3", "query": "query ScorecardCompressedV3($tournamentId: ID!, $playerId: ID!) {
 scorecardCompressedV3(tournamentId: $tournamentId, playerId: $playerId) {
 id
 payload
 }
}
", "variables": {"tournamentId": "R2026014", "playerId": "28237"}}'

A tournament's tee times: one row per player per group per round (tee time in UTC, starting tee, course). Endpoint URL: POST https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql Example request: curl -X POST 'https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"operationName": "TeeTimesCompressedV2", "query": "query TeeTimesCompressedV2($id: ID!) {
 teeTimesCompressedV2(id: $id) {
 id
 payload
 }
}
", "variables": {"id": "R2026014"}}'

Every stat a tour publishes: category, sub-category, stat id and title. The stat ids are what pgatour_stat_details takes. Endpoint URL: POST https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql Example request: curl -X POST 'https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"operationName": "StatOverview", "query": "query StatOverview($tourCode: TourCode!, $year: Int) {
 statOverview(tourCode: $tourCode, year: $year) {
 tourCode
 year
 categories {
 category
 displayName
 subCategories {
 displayName
 stats { statId statTitle }
 }
 }
 }
}
", "variables": {"tourCode": "R", "year": 2026}}'

One stat's season table, long form: one row per player per stat column (rank, column name, value as displayed). Endpoint URL: POST https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql Example request: curl -X POST 'https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"operationName": "StatDetails", "query": "query StatDetails($tourCode: TourCode!, $statId: String!, $year: Int) {
 statDetails(tourCode: $tourCode, statId: $statId, year: $year) {
 tourCode
 year
 statId
 statType
 statTitle
 statDescription
 tourAvg
 lastProcessed
 statHeaders
 rows {
 __typename
 ... on StatDetailsPlayer {
 playerId
 playerName
 country
 countryFlag
 rank
 rankDiff
 rankChangeTendency
 stats { statName statValue }
 }
 }
 }
}
", "variables": {"statId": "120", "tourCode": "R", "year": 2026}}'

A season-long points race (the FedExCup by default): one row per player with official and projected rank and points. Endpoint URL: POST https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql Example request: curl -X POST 'https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"operationName": "TourCupCombined", "query": "query TourCupCombined($tourCode: TourCode!, $id: String, $year: Int) {
 tourCupCombined(tourCode: $tourCode, id: $id, year: $year) {
 id
 title
 season
 description
 players {
 __typename
 ... on TourCupCombinedPlayer {
 id
 firstName
 lastName
 displayName
 shortName
 country
 countryFlag
 rankingData { projected official event movement movementAmount }
 pointData { projected official event movement movementAmount }
 }
 }
 }
}
", "variables": {"tourCode": "R", "id": "02671", "year": 2025}}'

ShotLink shot tracking for one player's round: one row per stroke with description, distance, lie and start / end coordinates. Endpoint URL: POST https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql Example request: curl -X POST 'https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"operationName": "ShotDetailsV4Compressed", "query": "query ShotDetailsV4Compressed($tournamentId: ID!, $playerId: ID!, $round: Int!, $includeRadar: Boolean) {
 shotDetailsV4Compressed(tournamentId: $tournamentId, playerId: $playerId, round: $round, includeRadar: $includeRadar) {
 id
 payload
 }
}
", "variables": {"tournamentId": "R2026006", "playerId": "59095", "round": 4}}'

The seasons a tour has a published schedule for: one row per season, the current one flagged. The seasons are what pgatour_schedule(year=) takes. Endpoint URL: POST https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql Example request: curl -X POST 'https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"operationName": "ScheduleYears", "query": "query ScheduleYears($tourCode: TourCode!) {
 scheduleYears(tourCode: $tourCode) {
 years {
 default
 displayValue
 queryValue
 }
 }
}
", "variables": {"tourCode": "R"}}'

Every past champion of a tournament: one row per edition (season, winner, total and score to par). Endpoint URL: POST https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql Example request: curl -X POST 'https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"operationName": "TournamentOverview", "query": "query TournamentOverview($tournamentId: ID!) {
 tournamentOverview(tournamentId: $tournamentId) {
 formatType
 pastChampions {
 year
 displaySeason
 playerId
 displayName
 countryCode
 total
 score
 }
 }
}
", "variables": {"tournamentId": "R2026014"}}'

Hole-by-hole scores of one round for the whole field: one row per player per hole (par, yardage, strokes, birdie / bogey status). Endpoint URL: POST https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql Example request: curl -X POST 'https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"operationName": "LeaderboardHoleByHole", "query": "query LeaderboardHoleByHole($tournamentId: ID!, $round: Int) {
 leaderboardHoleByHole(tournamentId: $tournamentId, round: $round) {
 tournamentId
 currentRound
 playerData {
 playerId
 courseId
 courseCode
 out
 in
 total
 totalToPar
 scores {
 holeNumber
 sequenceNumber
 par
 yardage
 score
 roundScore
 status
 }
 }
 }
}
", "variables": {"tournamentId": "R2026014", "round": 4}}'

A tournament's leaderboard stat table, long form: one row per player per stat (win / top 10 / make-cut chances by default). Endpoint URL: POST https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql Example request: curl -X POST 'https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"operationName": "LeaderboardStats", "query": "query LeaderboardStats($id: ID!, $statsType: LeaderboardStatsType) {
 leaderboardStats(id: $id, statsType: $statsType) {
 id
 type
 statIds
 titles
 players {
 playerId
 stats {
 statId
 value
 rank
 sortValue
 color
 }
 }
 }
}
", "variables": {"id": "R2026014", "statsType": "PROBABILITY"}}'

A tournament's field: one row per entered player, then the alternates (status, world ranking, how they qualified). Endpoint URL: POST https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql Example request: curl -X POST 'https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"operationName": "Field", "query": "query Field($id: ID!, $includeWithdrawn: Boolean) {
 field(id: $id, includeWithdrawn: $includeWithdrawn) {
 id
 players { ...FieldPlayer }
 alternates { ...FieldPlayer }
 }
}

fragment FieldPlayer on PlayerField {
 id
 firstName
 lastName
 displayName
 shortName
 country
 countryFlag
 amateur
 alternate
 withdrawn
 status
 owgr
 qualifier
 rankingPoints
}
", "variables": {"id": "R2026014", "includeWithdrawn": true}}'

One edition's final leaderboard: one row per player (position, total, score to par, round scores). Endpoint URL: POST https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql Example request: curl -X POST 'https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"operationName": "TournamentPastResults", "query": "query TournamentPastResults($id: ID!, $year: Int) {
 tournamentPastResults(id: $id, year: $year) {
 id
 players {
 position
 total
 parRelativeScore
 player {
 id
 firstName
 lastName
 displayName
 shortName
 country
 countryFlag
 amateur
 }
 rounds {
 score
 parRelativeScore
 }
 }
 }
}
", "variables": {"id": "R2026014", "year": 20250}}'

Hole difficulty for every course of a tournament: one row per hole per round (scoring average, rank, eagles to double bogeys). Endpoint URL: POST https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql Example request: curl -X POST 'https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"operationName": "CourseStats", "query": "query CourseStats($tournamentId: ID!) {
 courseStats(tournamentId: $tournamentId) {
 tournamentId
 courses {
 courseId
 courseName
 courseCode
 par
 yardage
 hostCourse
 roundHoleStats {
 roundHeader
 roundNum
 holeStats {
 __typename
 ... on CourseHoleStats {
 courseHoleNum
 parValue
 yards
 scoringAverage
 scoringAverageDiff
 rank
 eagles
 birdies
 pars
 bogeys
 doubleBogey
 }
 }
 }
 }
 }
}
", "variables": {"tournamentId": "R2026014"}}'

One player's stat lines for a tournament: one row per stat per round (performance, scoring and strokes gained, with the season-to-date value). Endpoint URL: POST https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql Example request: curl -X POST 'https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"operationName": "ScorecardStatsV3Compressed", "query": "query ScorecardStatsV3Compressed($id: ID!, $playerId: ID!) {
 scorecardStatsV3Compressed(id: $id, playerId: $playerId) {
 id
 payload
 }
}
", "variables": {"id": "R2026014", "playerId": "28237"}}'

A tour's player directory: one row per player (id, name, country, age, college, year turned pro). Endpoint URL: POST https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql Example request: curl -X POST 'https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"operationName": "PlayerDirectory", "query": "query PlayerDirectory($tourCode: TourCode!, $active: Boolean) {
 playerDirectory(tourCode: $tourCode, active: $active) {
 tourCode
 players {
 id
 isActive
 firstName
 lastName
 shortName
 displayName
 country
 countryFlag
 playerBio { age education turnedPro }
 }
 }
}
", "variables": {"tourCode": "R"}}'

A player's career results on a tour: one row per tournament edition played (finish, score to par, total, points, money, round scores). Endpoint URL: POST https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql Example request: curl -X POST 'https://orchestrator.pgatour.com/graphql' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"operationName": "PlayerProfileTournamentResults", "query": "query PlayerProfileTournamentResults($playerId: ID!, $tourCode: TourCode) {
 playerProfileTournamentResults(playerId: $playerId, tourCode: $tourCode) {
 playerId
 tournaments {
 tournamentNum
 tournaments {
 tournamentId
 tournamentName
 year
 startDate
 courseName
 position
 toPar
 total
 points
 pointsRank
 winnings
 roundScores {
 roundNum
 roundScore
 }
 }
 }
 }
}
", "variables": {"playerId": "28237", "tourCode": "R"}}'
